# Normalise to LF in the repository. A CRLF line ending inside a CSS
# data: URI silently broke every procedural texture once already, and the
# arcade ships inlined CSS in more than one game now.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.svg   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.webmanifest text eol=lf

# GitHub Pages reads the custom domain from this file; keep it a single
# LF-terminated line.
CNAME   text eol=lf
